  "status": "DOCUMENTED",
  "intent": "把对象的内部状态建模为独立对象，让状态转换的行为分散到各自状态实现中。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "state_count": "multiple_and_distinguishable",
      "transition_table": "explicit",
      "invalid_transitions": "must_be_representable",
      "object_identity": "stable_across_transitions"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "只有两三个状态且转换简单时，一个 `enum` + `match` 更短更安全",
      "状态数据没有差异、只是名称不同——用布尔标志即可"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.gof.behavioral.strategy",
      "pattern.gof.behavioral.command"
    ]
  },
